		<label>Anneli Faction Republic of Jurnizia</label>
		<description>In the distant past, a powerful annelitrice faction attempted to impose order on a chaotic planet under the banner of the Confederacy. Dissidents soon rose against them as the Rebels, and war followed. The Confederates were stronger, better organized, and almost always victorious, routinely crushing the Rebels and wiping out their forces. Yet somehow, the war never truly ended. New Rebels would appear, another campaign would begin, and the same conflict would play out again.\n\nWhat outsiders did not know was that both sides were made up of the same annelitrice. The endless war was an elaborate attempt to produce the perfect war movie. After thousands of repetitions, however, something finally went wrong. Against all expectations, the weaker Rebels won. Rather than stopping the movie production, they absorbed the surviving Confederates and rebranded the entire project as Jurnizia.\n\nAnnelitrice from Jurnizia are not particularly interested in conquest, but their pursuit of spectacular battles has left ruined settlements and countless casualties in its wake. Feared for their brutality, reckless audacity, and peculiar accent, the Jurnizia's army roam the planet in search of ever larger conflicts and ever better footage.</description>
